      "rewards+": [
        {
          "id": "crouch_glide_pose",
          "group": "A",
          "label": "相位姿态跟踪",
          "weight": 6,
          "direction": "positive",
          "confidence": "verified",
          "form": "\\frac{1}{14}\\sum_{j=1}^{14}\\exp\\!\\left(-e_j^{2}/\\sigma^{2}\\right)",
          "params": {
            "σ": 0.4,
            "std": 0.4,
            "descent_end": 0.1,
            "hold_end": 0.5,
            "rise_end": 0.6,
            "period_s": 5,
            "joints": "14 个舵机关节（按名字解析）"
          },
          "desc": "按相位在站姿与蹲姿之间线性插值出 14 个关节的目标角，每个关节的误差各过 σ = 0.4 rad 的高斯核再取均值：下蹲、蹲住滑行、起身都按同一条目标轨迹打分。",
          "note": "主奖励。e_j = q_j − q*_j(φ)。站姿端用 STAND_POSE（上游注释：真机 read_pose.py 读数），没有用仿真 HOME；蹲姿 CROUCH_POSE 同样是真机读数。上游注释：起身与下蹲按同一方式奖励，对称。一个 5 s 周期内 0.5 s 下蹲、2 s 蹲住、0.5 s 起身、2 s 站立；回合 20 s，约 4 个周期。函数：mjlab_microduck.tasks.mdp.crouch_glide_pose_by_phase（mdp.py:1478）。",
          "source": {
            "repo": "pollen-robotics/microduck_rl",
            "path": "src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microduck_roller_crouch_env_cfg.py",
            "symbol": "crouch_glide_pose"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "crouch_glide_pose_l1",
          "group": "A",
          "label": "相位姿态 L1",
          "weight": 2,
          "direction": "negative",
          "confidence": "verified",
          "form": "-\\frac{1}{14}\\sum_{j=1}^{14}\\left\\lvert e_j\\right\\rvert",
          "params": {
            "descent_end": 0.1,
            "hold_end": 0.5,
            "rise_end": 0.6,
            "joints": "14 个舵机关节（按名字解析）"
          },
          "desc": "同一条相位目标轨迹的 L1 版：14 个关节绝对误差的均值取负。",
          "note": "上游注释：L1 启动项——远离目标时高斯核已饱和，这一项仍给恒定梯度。⚠ 函数返回值 ≤ 0、权重为正，实际是惩罚。函数：mjlab_microduck.tasks.mdp.crouch_glide_pose_l1（mdp.py:1502）。",
          "source": {
            "repo": "pollen-robotics/microduck_rl",
            "path": "src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microduck_roller_crouch_env_cfg.py",
            "symbol": "crouch_glide_pose_l1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "forward_speed",
          "group": "A",
          "label": "保持前向速度",
          "weight": 1,
          "direction": "positive",
          "confidence": "verified",
          "form": "\\tanh\\!\\left(\\max(v_x,\\,0)/v_{\\text{ref}}\\right)",
          "params": {
            "vel_ref": 0.2
          },
          "desc": "奖励躯干保持向前滑行的速度，tanh 饱和，后退时为 0。",
          "note": "上游注释：保住入场冲量、不要刹车；与指令无关（twist 指令通道装的是相位，不是速度）。入场速度由 reset_base 的 velocity_range x ∈ [0.2, 0.5] m/s 注入（cfg:256）。函数：mjlab_microduck.tasks.mdp.forward_speed_reward（mdp.py:1400）。",
          "source": {
            "repo": "pollen-robotics/microduck_rl",
            "path": "src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microduck_roller_crouch_env_cfg.py",
            "symbol": "forward_speed"
          },
          "curve": {
            "x": {
              "tex": "v_x",
              "range": [
                -0.2,
                1
              ]
            },
            "f": "tanh(max(x, 0) / vref)",
            "params": [
              {
                "id": "vref",
                "key": "vel_ref",
                "range": [
                  0.05,
                  0.8
                ],
                "log": true
              }
            ],
            "notes": [
              "横轴是机体系前向速度 v_x（m/s）。v_x ≤ 0 时为 0；v_x = v_ref 时为 tanh(1) ≈ 0.76，再快就趋于饱和 1。"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "crouch_forward_lean",
          "group": "B",
          "label": "下蹲前倾",
          "weight": 1,
          "direction": "positive",
          "confidence": "verified",
          "form": "b(\\phi)\\cdot\\exp\\!\\left(-(g_x-\\theta^{*})^{2}/\\sigma^{2}\\right)",
          "params": {
            "target_pitch": 0.08,
            "σ": 0.1,
            "std": 0.1,
            "descent_end": 0.1,
            "hold_end": 0.5,
            "rise_end": 0.6
          },
          "desc": "只在下蹲、蹲住、起身阶段生效：奖励躯干略微前倾约 0.08（≈ 4.6°）。",
          "note": "上游注释：真机快速下蹲时观察到向后翻，用轻微前倾抵消；由与姿态项相同的混合系数 b(φ) 门控，站立段不偏置（注释说“下蹲 + 蹲住段为 1”，代码里下蹲段实际是 0→1 线性爬升）。函数：mjlab_microduck.tasks.mdp.crouch_forward_lean（mdp.py:1524）。",
          "source": {
            "repo": "pollen-robotics/microduck_rl",
            "path": "src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microduck_roller_crouch_env_cfg.py",
            "symbol": "crouch_forward_lean"
          },
          "curve": {
            "x": {
              "tex": "g_x",
              "range": [
                -0.2,
                0.4
              ]
            },
            "f": "b * exp(-((x - th) ^ 2) / (s * s))",
            "params": [
              {
                "id": "th",
                "key": "target_pitch",
                "range": [
                  0,
                  0.3
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "s",
                "key": "std",
                "range": [
                  0.025,
                  0.4
                ],
                "log": true
              }
            ],
            "held": [
              {
                "id": "b",
                "tex": "b(\\phi)",
                "range": [
                  0,
                  1
                ],
                "value": 1
              }
            ],
            "notes": [
              "横轴是躯干系投影重力的 x 分量 g_x（前倾为正，约等于俯仰角的正弦）。相位门控 b(φ) 用滑块固定，默认 1（蹲住段）；站立段 b = 0，整项为 0，下蹲 / 起身段 b 在 0 与 1 之间线性变化。"
            ]
          }
        },
